WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.460
- If anyone is on the
field and is disrespectful

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:05.617
to the anthem or the flag,

00:00:05.617 --> 00:00:08.808
there would be a fine from
the league against the team.

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:11.558
(dramatic music)

00:00:24.719 --> 00:00:26.219
- The NFL, without

00:00:26.326 --> 00:00:27.691
the player's union...
- Knee capped.

00:00:27.691 --> 00:00:31.649
- Has decided to attack
the lack of standing before

00:00:31.649 --> 00:00:32.793
the National Anthem.

00:00:32.793 --> 00:00:34.592
- We've listened to a lot
of different viewpoints,

00:00:34.592 --> 00:00:36.650
including our fans' over the last year,

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:41.036
and I think this policy
attempts to come out in a place

00:00:41.036 --> 00:00:43.737
where we respected everybody's
point of view in this.

00:00:43.737 --> 00:00:45.154
- All 32 clubs...

00:00:46.403 --> 00:00:49.449
want to make sure that during the moment

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:51.316
of the Anthem and the flag,

00:00:51.316 --> 00:00:54.281
that that is a very important
moment to all of us,

00:00:54.281 --> 00:00:57.498
as a league, as clubs,
personally and to our country.

00:00:57.498 --> 00:01:01.145
- You have to stand proudly
for the National Anthem,

00:01:01.145 --> 00:01:03.014
or you shouldn't be playing,
you shouldn't be there.

00:01:03.014 --> 00:01:05.049
Maybe you shouldn't be in the country.

00:01:05.049 --> 00:01:07.689
You have to stand proudly
for the National Anthem.

00:01:07.689 --> 00:01:10.109
- There's been incredible engagement

00:01:10.109 --> 00:01:11.658
with the players on this.

00:01:11.658 --> 00:01:15.239
We've talked to tens, if
not hundreds of players

00:01:15.239 --> 00:01:18.239
about this over the last year or so,

00:01:18.289 --> 00:01:20.831
to get their input, to
understand their positions.

00:01:20.831 --> 00:01:23.122
- All players who are on the
field when the National Anthem

00:01:23.122 --> 00:01:25.705
plays must stand or face fines.

00:01:26.093 --> 00:01:28.381
Mike Pence celebrated
with a spontaneous tweet,

00:01:28.381 --> 00:01:29.875
"Hashtag winning."

00:01:29.875 --> 00:01:31.866
Well, maybe not so fast, Mike Pence.

00:01:31.866 --> 00:01:34.616
(dramatic music)

